{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344450/extras/1.gif?t=1737373356\" /><br><strong>Collect devastating power-ups and unleash chaos on your opponents to claim the crown!</strong><br><br><strong>Touch</strong> your opponents when you are <strong>invulnerable </strong>or <strong>escape</strong> if they are!<br><br>Trick your opponents using a combination of <strong>skill-based movement</strong> and <strong>powerups</strong> to reach the <strong>crown</strong> in <strong>special levels</strong>!<br><br>Dodge <strong>deadly lasers</strong> and precarious ledges to stay in the game - <strong>quick reflexes</strong> are key to victory!<br><br>Be careful which <strong>buttons</strong> you touch - some hold <strong>surprises</strong> that can help or destroy you!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344450/extras/lasers2.gif?t=1737373356\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge your <strong>friends</strong> or <strong>AI</strong> opponents in <strong>thrilling and chaotic PVP battles</strong> up to <strong>4</strong> players<br></li><li><strong>Unleash</strong> a barrage of explosive power-ups, including <strong>bombs, rockets, mines, and turrets</strong><br></li><li><strong>Become smaller, faster and invisible</strong> to avoid your opponents or strike them<br></li><li><strong>Strike</strong> your enemies when you have the <strong>yellow glow</strong> and <strong>dodge</strong> their assaults when they have the upper hand<br></li><li>Reach the <strong>crown</strong> in some <strong>special levels</strong> to <strong>win</strong> instantly the round<br></li><li>Disable weapon power-ups and challenge your friends in a <strong>peaceful gameplay mode</strong><br></li><li><strong>60</strong> unique <strong>levels </strong>with explosive <strong>surprises</strong>, <strong>lasers</strong>, <strong>buttons</strong> and <strong>bombs</strong><br></li><li><strong>Physics-Based movement</strong>, watch out to fall down!</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344450/extras/turrets2.gif?t=1737373356\" /><br><br><strong>NOTE: If you have problems with controller in game, just disable all controllers in Steam Big Picture</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Scroterized!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/e20e5fa71708b7b89e3c35f45aa13f105a6632f6.jpg"},{"name":"Dumb Ways to Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/80231b90a48275e5aa04d6e5fda40598d95b3560.jpg"},{"name":"A Hundred Ways to Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/f49bdad328227f9a4743b2663ef9c5bddb9153cd.jpg"},{"name":"Death Becomes Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/37dab9b53745acb718a9f4b22d55e3454b450782.jpg"},{"name":"Decimation Domination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/3a133b2edf6075e878aa813a353eace00b222284.jpg"},{"name":"Victory Marathoner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/26c7347e41daf0a9037e228a5c212231112ab9a1.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/21e563e2309ec4fea1857f8b4f24c3dddaa17450.jpg"},{"name":"Royal Newbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/22aa322dc7f712ae638b35d59025f55a692cc7df.jpg"},{"name":"Ghostly High-Five","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/61fd32ff496703efdaacdc33a433a3c40e0715ea.jpg"},{"name":"Spectral Karma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2344450/dad28554cf3c13349afc86d1920ded9b83292094.jpg"}],"